  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scatec Green Hydrogen Framework - Feasibility studies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility studies for green hydrogen projects in Egypt, Tunisia, Marocco and South Asia. The company will use their experiences from the Egypt Fertiglobe project to develop new projects. The Hydrogen will be produced from Solar and wind, and be processed to Green Ammonia.</narrative>
  </description>
